---
description: Reconcile work-in-progress with reporting obligations and production derivatives.
args:{issue:IssueState;commissions:Commission[];checkpoint:EditorialCheckpoint}
returns:IssueFinding[]
---
For each laid-out piece verify accepted commission, reporting completion, fact-check references, and rights for every placed asset. Compare headlines and promotional text against article claims. A withdrawal invalidates layout and asks portfolio coverage to select a prequalified contingency; never preserve a withdrawn assignment as a silent placeholder. Track the piece revision and all dependent visual and credit revisions.
